    "prompt": "In one slow intimate fixed-camera drawn anime shot, the seated red-haired woman begins with heavy lowered eyes and her relaxed hand supported beside the upright mug. Moisture gradually gathers at the lower eyelids; one or two small translucent tear tracks develop naturally downward over her cheeks. She gently raises and turns her head only a few degrees toward the man at screen-left and looks at him with wet eyes, a minutely pinched brow and vulnerable slightly unsteady parted lips. Preserve this quiet eye contact and small tears through the ending, without dropping her gaze again or adding a smile, nod or broad expression reset. The man remains beside her with exhausted contained care and a soft responsive look, without an embrace or reassuring grin. Same face, freckles, hair, story clothes, round pendants, hand ownership, unmoving supported mug and table, ordinary kitchen light. Coherent gradual eye/head/breath movement; tears begin at eyelids, not random skin or glowing lines. Emotional contact remains ambiguous grief and possible opening, not a triumphant cure.",
